      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Recreate as an Excalidraw drawing:\n\nLeft container (your laptop, on Fedora 43 or macOS):\n  - Top row: podman, buildah, skopeo\n  - Middle row: cosign, syft, grype\n  - Bottom row: podman-compose, Podman Desktop, jq\n\nRight container (registries):\n  - registry.access.redhat.com (UBI builder images)\n  - quay.io/hummingbird (Hummingbird runtime images, accent in red)\n  - Optional internal mirror (dashed, for air-gapped)\n\nArrows from the laptop tools to the registries showing pull/push.\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recreate as an Excalidraw drawing:\n\nLeft container (your laptop, on Fedora 43 or macOS):\n  - Top row: podman, buildah, skopeo\n  - Middle row: cosign, syft, grype\n  - Bottom row: podman-compose, Podman Desktop, jq\n\nRight container (registries):\n  - registry.access.redhat.com (UBI builder images)\n  - quay.io/hummingbird (Hummingbird runtime images, accent in red)\n  - Optional internal mirror (dashed, for air-gapped)\n\nArrows from the laptop tools to the registries showing pull/push.\n",
